(KING OF TOKYO - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Giant monsters fight for Tokyo. Win by reaching 20 victory points or by being the last) Tj T*
(monster standing. Each monster starts with 10 life points and 0 victory points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ROLLING DICE) Tj T*
(Roll 6 dice. You may reroll any of them up to 2 more times \(3 rolls in total\). Then) Tj T*
(resolve the final faces:) Tj T*
(- Numbers: three of a kind scores that many points \(three 2s = 2 points\). Each extra) Tj T*
(   die of the) Tj T*
(same number adds 1 point.) Tj T*
(- Heart: heal 1 life point \(not while you are in Tokyo\). The maximum is 10.) Tj T*
(- Energy: take 1 energy cube.) Tj T*
(- Claw: deal 1 damage.) Tj T*
ET
