(TOKYO) Tj T*
(- If you are in Tokyo, your claws damage every monster outside Tokyo.) Tj T*
(- If you are outside, your claws damage the monster in Tokyo. That monster may yield) Tj T*
(   Tokyo; then) Tj T*
(you must take its place.) Tj T*
(- If Tokyo is empty, the active monster must enter it.) Tj T*
(- Entering Tokyo gives 1 victory point. Starting your turn in Tokyo gives 2 victory) Tj T*
(   points.) Tj T*
(With 5 or 6 players, Tokyo Bay is also used as a second place in Tokyo.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BUYING CARDS) Tj T*
(After resolving the dice you may buy face-up power cards with energy. You may pay 2) Tj T*
(energy to discard the 3 face-up cards and reveal new ones. Keep cards stay in front of) Tj T*
(you; Discard cards work once.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING) Tj T*
(The first monster to reach 20 victory points wins, or the last monster still alive.) Tj T*
ET
